OL,3,AUK should 'team up' with Canada in new
OL,4,AEurope alliance, Canadian minister
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK should "team up" with a proposed
OL,8,Feconomic alliance between Canada and
OL,9,FEurope, Canadian Finance Minister
OL,10,FFrancois-Philippe Champagne has said.
OL,12,F"This is all about the substance, to
OL,13,Fbuild an alliance of the future," he
OL,14,Ftold the BBC. "The world has changed.
OL,15,FAmerica has changed. So we need to
OL,16,Fchange."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
