OL,3,AUK should 'team up' with Canada in new
OL,4,AEurope alliance, Canadian minister
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FChampagne also gave a frank assessment
OL,8,Fof the Canada-US trade war after a deal
OL,9,Fcollapsed last month, saying the
OL,10,Fcountry had "stood up for our
OL,11,Findustries, our workers, our country"
OL,12,Fby imposing tariffs.
OL,14,FHis comments come after European
OL,15,FCommission President Ursula von der
OL,16,FLeyen proposed "opening the door" to an
OL,17,Fassociate EU membership for Canada, an
OL,18,Funprecedented move for the bloc.
